        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Whit Stillman, Greta Gerwig, Taylor Nichols, Adam Brody, Analeigh Tipton\n- Works: Damsels in Distress, Lady Bird\n- Topics: American film, acting, filmmaking\n\nFacts:\n- Taylor Nichols was born on March 3, 1959, in Louisville, Kentucky.\n- Greta Gerwig was born on August 4, 1983, and she is an American actress and filmmaker.\n- Damsels in Distress is an American comedy film written and directed by Whit Stillman, and it stars Greta Gerwig, Adam Brody, and Analeigh Tipton.\n- Damsels in Distress was originally titled Violet Wister's Damsels in Distress and Whit Stillman's Damsels in Distress.\n- Taylor Nichols is an American actor best known for roles in Whit Stillman films including Metropolitan, Barcelona, The Last Days of Disco, and Damsels in Distress.\n- Lady Bird is a 2017 American comedy-drama film written and directed by Greta Gerwig.",
